<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3932/37  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.8640/47  German Marks</p>
<p>		     2.1000/10  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.5268/78  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     38.36/37   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     6.2795/15  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1817.8/8.8 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     116.15/20  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.9850/00  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.6727/47  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.0994/14  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.5895/05</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$328.20/70</p>
</text>
